@startuml state-request
' Figure: Request state machine (D4, D9, D11, D12). Guards are spelled out in Section 4.8.
' Withdraw is drawn once from Draft; it is also allowed from Pending and Waiting. Allocated, Withdrawn, Refused are final.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam nodesep 10
skinparam ranksep 18
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FA
  BorderColor #223
  FontStyle bold
}
hide empty description
[*] --> Draft : Manager creates
Draft --> Draft : edit lines,\naccept Suggestions
Draft --> Submitted : submit (Required\nlines affordable)
Submitted --> Allocated : no approval needed,\nall Required satisfiable
Submitted --> Pending : approvals needed;\nHolds placed, Window starts
Submitted --> Waiting : a Required line\nunsatisfiable; waitlisted
Pending --> Allocated : last approval; Holds\ncommit, Charges post
Pending --> Waiting : refusal or Window\nlapses; Holds release
Pending --> Refused : refused, no\nCandidate left
Waiting --> Pending : replacement picked\n(Window still running)
Waiting --> Allocated : all Required\nsatisfiable at once
Waiting --> Draft : edit
Waiting --> Refused : escalated approval\nrefused, no Candidate left
Allocated --> Waiting : Required line\nBumped (full Refund)
Allocated --> Allocated : Release (Refund)
Draft --> Withdrawn : withdraw (also from\nPending and Waiting)
@enduml
